  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">This bag is made of our new innovative material, UpcraftedLeather. It is not leather, instead it’s made with at least 50% leather fibers, entangled through a recycled textile mesh, retanned and then finished for shine, texture and durability. Inspired by vintage sport silhouettes, it fits your smallest essentials—phone, card case, keys, lip gloss—and is finished with a zip-top closure. Carry it to flea markets, wine bars and last-minute plans</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Main: Smooth UpcraftedLeather (at least 50% leather fibers, balance made with synthetic materials)</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: Recycled polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> N/A</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Adjustable shoulder strap with 8.2&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
